      "category": "headings",
      "tags": [
        "headings"
      ],
      "description": "Headings all use the first heading's style: # Title, # Title #, or underlined.",
      "rationale": "One heading style makes the source easier to read and to search.",
      "fix": "The fix converts headings between the # Title and # Title # styles. gomdlint reports an underlined heading, or one that needs an underline, without a fix. gomdlint may report a finding without a fix when the fix would change a line with one character in brackets, such as [x] or [1], or the lines around it up to a blank line, because it could add or remove a task list checkbox.",
      "fixable": true,
